	description="Andrii Oriekhov, full-stack TypeScript engineer from Ukraine."
>
	<p>
		I'm Andrii Oriekhov, a full-stack TypeScript engineer from Ukraine with 6+ years of experience.
	</p>

	<p>
		I enjoy AST tooling, codemods, developer tools and graphs, and working on products where the
		impact is visible. I'm an active open source contributor with 200+ merged PRs, from new features
		and lint rules to bug fixes and docs in popular JavaScript and Python projects.
	</p>

	<h2>Work</h2>

	<p>
		Since 2020 I've been at SPD Ukraine. Most of that time I've worked on a FinTech payments platform
		for businesses: merchant financial reporting, real-time reports on a new data platform, revenue
		features like surcharges and same-day payouts, and a lot of frontend modernization and code
		health work across 20+ repositories. Before that I built a metadata-driven app builder, a medical
		ERP and an internal task tracker.
	</p>

	<p>
		<strong>Stack:</strong> TypeScript, React, Next.js, Node.js, GraphQL, React Query, Redux Toolkit,
		Tailwind CSS, Kafka, Redis, PostgreSQL, Docker, Vitest, Playwright, GitHub Actions. Also Ember,
		Vue, Angular and Python.
	</p>

	<p>MSc in Computer Science, Cherkasy State Technological University.</p>

